<div>
    <h3>西电赴国家版本馆开展资助育人·行走课堂主题研学活动</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2026-04-13 15:01:31<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 33042)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_2 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">4月8日，学生资助管理中心组织师生走进国家版本馆西安分馆，开展“资助育人・行走课堂”主题研学活动</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">邀请</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本科生班主任</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">人文学院李皓老师</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">指导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，学生资助宣传大使代表、笃行班成员及各学院学生代表共 50 余人参加。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 387.35pt; height: 290.55pt;"><img src="/__local/2/D3/E4/813A1196645993754BEDB1EDD43_841BBC7A_772F8.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/2D3E4813A1196645993754BEDB1EDD43/841BBC7A/772F8" vheight=" 290.55pt" vwidth=" 387.35pt" orisrc="/__local/B/2D/0A/2DC93DEB54596A7D11BE3087BFC_C9232859_145180.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 387.35pt; height: 290.55pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">在班主任李皓老师的引导下，同学们带着</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">版本是什么，如何认识版本这一文明的载体？</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">”</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">的思考开启了研学之旅。版本馆内，大家循着丝路历史线，沉浸式感受从先秦丝路传奇到新时代共建“一带一路”</span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">的文明传承，系统学习中华文明发展脉络与西部红色历史，在历史与现实的对话中，深刻感悟中华文明绵延不绝的深厚底蕴，以及延安精神等红色基因的时代延续。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">参观结束后，李皓老师带领同学们围绕研学所见，现场开展了一场生动的班主任导学研讨课。她以“唐代考生的课本从何而来”为趣味切入点，通过“开成石经”典故，生动科普了古代“版本学”的实践应用，随后引导同学们结合馆内所见分享感悟，从“版本”视角深化对文化传承与青年使命的认知。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 308.3pt; height: 231.25pt;"><img src="/__local/2/98/E3/2E755DE8329F281B410A30C826E_EF09E678_64351.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/298E32E755DE8329F281B410A30C826E/EF09E678/64351" vheight=" 231.25pt" vwidth=" 308.3pt" orisrc="/__local/9/94/15/7F44C0533977E526C88A653BD6D_B4EDC3B6_12A892.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 308.3pt; height: 231.25pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生资助宣传大使代表李震华说道，此次“行走课堂”让我跳出专业学习，真切感受到中华文明的厚重璀璨。班主任老师深入浅出的讲解也让我对“版本”有了新的认识，今后我将在深耕专业的同时涵养人文底蕴，努力成长为全面发展的新时代青年。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">经济与管理学院赵若楠同学说道，这是一次理论与实践融合的研学之旅，甲骨拓片、丝路文书等古今版本在这里交相辉映，我们既感叹“藏之名山，传之后世”的深刻内涵，更坚定了传承中华优秀传统文化，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">勇担时代使命，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">讲好中国故事的责任与担当。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 284.55pt; height: 216.5pt;"><img src="/__local/A/19/78/0E5DA0D47D90A6CDD9FC2748064_F10AC533_1343F.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/A19780E5DA0D47D90A6CDD9FC2748064/F10AC533/1343F" vheight=" 216.5pt" vwidth=" 284.55pt" orisrc="/__local/7/12/71/4EDEDA8DF3EB01C0DFCCA172EC7_3EB7018C_1241C.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 284.55pt; height: 216.5pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">据悉，“资助育人·行走课堂”系列活动是学校FAST发展型资助育人体系的品牌活动，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">旨在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">拓宽学生视野</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">在实践中增长才干</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本次活动将</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">资助育人与本科生导学实践</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">有机</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">融合，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">是落实学生自我发展计划的积极尝试。后续，</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">将结合筑梦行动，统筹整合班主任、校友校外企业等育人资源，大力开展实践研学，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">打造</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“目标适配+资助托举+实践强知+全面发展”的多项成长引育行动。</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
<div class="editor" style="margin-top:20px;">责任编辑：王鑫</div>
    



